  "question": {
    "text": "In a compound oxide ion have ccp arrangement, cations A are present in <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> of the tetrahedral voids and cations B occupy <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> of the octahedral voids. What are the formula of the compound?",
