  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Oxide ions are forming the lattice<br />Effective number of oxide ions <math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> Tetrahedral voids <math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br />And effective number of A atom <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Number of octahedral voids <math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br />Effective number of B atom <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> Molecular formulae <math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
